  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In Mini Central Continent a huge area of mirror willows forms a giant forest spanning a hundred li. Fang Yuan originally planted them in Hu Immortal blessed land, then relocated them here, and the sovereign immortal aperture’s time flow lets the forest reach that scale without his effort. There is also a huge underground blood zhi forest only slightly smaller than the mirror willows. Mini Central Continent is too huge for those plants to meet competitors, so they grow freely.",
      "chapters": [
        1159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Mini Central Continent the blood zhi forest and mirror willows from Hu Immortal blessed land remain, and there is also a small jade light pit holding a large quantity of light path mortal Gu. Fang Yuan creates that small pit after ransacking Northern Plains’ Liu tribe jade light pit, using it only to store the light path Gu worms. It has no production capabilities compared with the genuine resource point. Mini Central Continent has the least development among the five mini regions.",
      "chapters": [
        1291
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "storage-pit-creation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "fac_liu_tribe",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "An immortal Gu formation is set up in Mini Central Continent: the self cleansing immortal Gu formation. Self love Immortal Gu is the core of the rank seven formation, with formation flag Immortal Gu as the supplement. Once activated it constantly cleanses harmful dao marks, and because of formation flag Immortal Gu the formation can be moved temporarily.",
      "chapters": [
        1422
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "self-cleansing-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "sys_self_cleansing_immortal_formation",
        "gu_self_love_immortal_gu",
        "gu_formation_flag_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Mini Central Continent there is a blood zhi forest and mirror willow forest grown casually by Fang Yuan without purposeful nurturing, their scale not big. There is also a jade light pit that has light path mortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "casual-forests-and-pit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan places City Well in Mini Central Continent. The mini city inside City Well has already been destroyed, and Miniscule Mountain has been removed, but many blessed lands of Gu Immortals killed with City Well remain inside. With City Well he can raise variant humans and even pure bred humans in isolation.",
      "chapters": [
        1489
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "city-well-placement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_city_well",
        "loc_miniscule_mountain",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Mini Central Continent there is now a phantom shadow flower garden and a large fertile land filled with an enormous amount of immortal farmer soil.",
      "chapters": [
        1615
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "shadow-garden-and-soil",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
